# c3 Field

This repository is the active source of truth for the c3 Field governance architecture.

It contains the canonical structure, governance protocols, system architecture, and installation framework required to maintain coherence under AI-accelerated conditions.

## Structure

- `docs/field-canon/` → foundational field-level truth
- `docs/protocols/` → governance decision pathways
- `docs/systems/` → schema, execution logic, and system structure
- `docs/model/` → c3 model architecture
- `docs/installations/` → external implementation and cohort structure

## Exclusions

This repository does not contain:

- legacy token systems
- deprecated glossary layers
- exploratory or symbolic language
- historical whitepapers

These exist as archival materials outside the canonical system.

## Status

Active  
Authoritative  
Maintained
